{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "00739e18f56058d9aeb087d74f20b0bcc1e76f85f8593bf6c9ef99139b5fac78", "ja": "～抑えきれない気持ち～", "zh": "～无法抑制的心情～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "6237c62e87c93295267536e83727464ca4151f8d967f0510836ff3eda5dfe5f7", "ja": "本番を明日に控え、早くもオンモードの\n杏奈と、つられてテンションが上がる\nやよい。そんなふたりを見て、緊張して\nいた奈緒と恵美も、明日は自分達らしく\n頑張ろうと、気持ちを新たにした。", "zh": "正式演出就在明天，杏奈早早就进入了状态，\n而被她带动的弥生也兴奋起来。\n看到这样的两人，原本有些紧张的奈绪和惠美\n也重新振作起来，决定明天以自己的方式\n努力加油。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_04_1000_024ann", "source_sha256": "7a8b19db63bc7142a6d6fa21704c7b8101e89b61f51b711e172ca23e97528dca", "ja": "イエーイ！　みんな、調子はどう？", "zh": "耶——！大家状态怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_04_1001_037nao", "source_sha256": "97ceca695027abca21d9ccfbce39ac7b2505264bf87a24abecb7e73ce2298d91", "ja": "バッチリやー！ってなんや、本番は明日やのに\n杏奈はもう、ビビッとモードなんやな？", "zh": "太棒了——！话说回来，正式演出明明是明天，杏奈已经进入兴奋模式了啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_04_1002_024ann", "source_sha256": "2b640ad6f6a6fbebb11900d9ab32883ee1f8e183944b7ebeb54d6dce1a428b20", "ja": "うんっ！　ステージの準備が進んでるのを見たらもう、\n杏奈のテンション、フルスロットルです！", "zh": "嗯！看到舞台准备工作顺利进行，杏奈的情绪已经全开了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_04_1003_020meg", "source_sha256": "ed087f4d2fd15ab3942e77a43f676e9772e1eee5a987ded72549da25f89b6e68", "ja": "いいねいいねー！　杏奈ノリノリじゃん！\nなんか、アタシまでアガっちゃうよ～！", "zh": "不错不错～！杏奈这不是超起劲的嘛！\n搞得我也跟着嗨起来了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_04_1004_005yay", "source_sha256": "ece71561dccd80158715c9a00cb2a5118069ef392a1a977fbf3d414d4afe06d6", "ja": "うっうー！　私も、元気になってきちゃいました！\nビビッといっちゃいまーす！　いぇい！", "zh": "呜呜！我也渐渐打起精神来了！我要活力满满地上咯——！耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_04_1005_037nao", "source_sha256": "84e0ebbea36ed2c2146f3dfa7cbfb3472d5167fd3e8d18f22440343f371d163a", "ja": "あはは！　なんや私、今から緊張してたんやけど、\nみんな見てたら、なんとかなるって思えてきたわ。", "zh": "啊哈哈！我刚才还在紧张呢，\n但一看到大家，就觉得总会有办法的了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_04_1006_020meg", "source_sha256": "a5b92c223834c5674be1753df1c51984485601e13f2a5290da55d6689ded6512", "ja": "あ、奈緒も緊張してたんだ？　実はアタシもなんだよ\nね～。でも、アタシ達らしくやれば大丈夫だよね！", "zh": "啊，奈绪原来也很紧张啊？其实我也是呢～。不过，只要按我们的风格来就没问题了吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_04_1007_005yay", "source_sha256": "627f7fb3e153d30f80afe69654a5964fddabaf9844e772ffc68d7d8d172e29a6", "ja": "はいっ！　レッスンの時みたいに、\n明日はみんなで元気よく、頑張りましょー！", "zh": "好的！明天也像练习时那样，大家一起精神满满地加油吧——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_04_1008_024ann", "source_sha256": "74dd0674374b667434a7e0f1c5cf8c1ba5e6d4d7fb5b184859ff94c675aae8b1", "ja": "杏奈たち、仲間だから！　みんなで力を合わせたら、\nどんなボスだって、たお……せ……。スヤァ……。", "zh": "因为杏奈和大家是伙伴嘛！只要大家齐心协力，任何Boss都能打……倒……呼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_04_1009_037nao", "source_sha256": "8a3c83726316f0aaaa21e7b42238db0bb22c529bfaffa16d35d526efcad98d1c", "ja": "わあっ！　杏奈、急にそんなとこで寝たらあかん！\n風邪ひいてまうで！", "zh": "哇！杏奈，突然睡在那种地方可不行啊！会着凉的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_04_1010_020meg", "source_sha256": "7c4a52ad1d9024ceb0b9bd6990b4125d173a77c14d045ed971c1276fb07b6752", "ja": "にゃはは♪　最近、レッスンハードだったからね～。\nアタシ達も、今日はゆっくり寝て、明日に備えよっ！", "zh": "呀哈哈♪ 最近的训练确实很辛苦嘛～  \n我们今天也好好睡一觉，为明天做准备吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_04_1011_005yay", "source_sha256": "1e54d40e95554c6b9bfecccda410f518fd47d3ea113c59b9188a81cb3a9641ec", "ja": "みなさーん！！　私たちのライブを見に来てくれて\nありがとうございまーす！　いぇいっ！", "zh": "各位观众——！！　非常感谢大家来看\n我们的演出——！　耶——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_04_1012_020meg", "source_sha256": "26167e2e454caed7331c3266cfa6ecb20eae8148c2972f9b16171e09a9b15820", "ja": "最後まですっごいアゲアゲでいっちゃうから\n覚悟しといてよー！　にゃはは♪", "zh": "我们会嗨到最后，你们可要有心理准备哦——！　哈哈哈♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_04_1013_037nao", "source_sha256": "9bd0fafe49351019ea2276b9011a05361edf89585db346ab7826dc56a977a009", "ja": "スイッチ入りっぱなしの私らのこと、\n一瞬でも見逃したらアカンでー！", "zh": "我们可是一直保持着兴奋状态的，哪怕一瞬间也不准错过哦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_04_1014_024ann", "source_sha256": "d48252874cb24b810c21fedd4adb830d17d1261c929334f8551d82701d4a474e", "ja": "それじゃあ……行っくよー！\nバッチリ、応援くださーいっ！", "zh": "那么……要上了哦——！\n请务必给我们加油——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_04_1015_audience", "source_sha256": "d4a24de7732f4fc96422562f5cbf6af59494bc5a2eff23580ef50ef09e85feb2", "ja": "ワアアアアアアアアアアアア！！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
